  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ENTERPRISE - Enabling and empowering a business environment to establish and sustain income-generating and employment opportunities for vulnerable communities in Uva and Central Provinces</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OO: To contribute to improved socio-economic wellbeing of rural and estate communities in Uva and Central Province. SO: To support the development of an enabling and empowering business environment for establishing and sustaining income-generating and employment opportunities for vulnerable women, youth and their communities in Uva and Central Provinces.</narrative>
  </description>
